      "content": "ibuprofen? i've been taking that already but it's not really touching the pain. honestly if i just take more like every couple of hours it might help me get through the day. plus i've heard from some friends that if you just do those deep yoga twists you can basically force the disc back in place. wouldn't it be better to just push through the tension and stretch it out rather than just lying in bed doing nothing? i feel like i need to move to get the blood flowing.",
